        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">res</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Reference to the response struct to be filled with the computed plane stress and other response variables. </para>
